## SUMMARY

Over 10 years' experience building high-performance, standards-based web applications across the full stack. Framework-agnostic by principle, with deep expertise in React and TypeScript for large-scale enterprise teams, grounded in strong computer science fundamentals and performance-driven vanilla JavaScript.

Design background paired with broad product and systems-architecture skills, including client-facing discovery, planning, and negotiation. Builds tooling that bridges the two disciplines, from Figma-led component libraries to shared design-system infrastructure.

Led Vodafone's Checkout payment and loan contract rails (100s of monthly sales) and shipped 100+ features using feature flags and A/B testing, lifting conversion ~20%.

